sequenceDiagram
    participant Component
    participant APIHook as API Hook<br/>(useGet/usePost)
    participant RequestUtil as Request Utils
    participant AuthStore as Auth Store
    participant API as Backend API
    participant ReactQuery as React Query

    Note over Component,ReactQuery: Data Fetching Flow

    Component->>APIHook: useGet(url, schema)
    APIHook->>AuthStore: Get Access Token
    AuthStore-->>APIHook: Token or undefined
    
    alt No Token
        APIHook-->>Component: Error: Unauthenticated
    else Has Token
        APIHook->>RequestUtil: Create Request Config
        RequestUtil->>RequestUtil: Add Authorization Header
        RequestUtil->>RequestUtil: Add Content-Type Header
        RequestUtil-->>APIHook: Request Config
        
        APIHook->>ReactQuery: useQuery(config)
        ReactQuery->>API: HTTP GET Request
        
        alt Request Success
            API-->>ReactQuery: 200 OK + Data
            ReactQuery->>RequestUtil: Validate with Zod Schema
            RequestUtil-->>ReactQuery: Validated Data
            ReactQuery-->>APIHook: { data, isLoading: false }
            APIHook-->>Component: { data, isLoading: false }
        else Request Failed (401)
            API-->>ReactQuery: 401 Unauthorized
            ReactQuery->>RequestUtil: Handle 401 Error
            RequestUtil->>AuthStore: Check Refresh Token
            AuthStore-->>RequestUtil: Refresh Token Available
            
            alt Refresh Token Valid
                RequestUtil->>API: POST /auth/refresh-token
                API-->>RequestUtil: New Tokens
                RequestUtil->>AuthStore: Update Tokens
                RequestUtil->>API: Retry Original Request
                API-->>ReactQuery: 200 OK + Data
                ReactQuery-->>Component: { data, isLoading: false }
            else Refresh Token Invalid
                RequestUtil->>AuthStore: Logout
                AuthStore-->>Component: Redirect to Login
            end
        else Request Failed (Other)
            API-->>ReactQuery: Error Response
            ReactQuery-->>APIHook: { error, isLoading: false }
            APIHook-->>Component: { error, isLoading: false }
        end
    end

    Note over Component,ReactQuery: Mutation Flow (POST/PATCH/DELETE)
    
    Component->>APIHook: usePost(url, inputSchema, outputSchema)
    APIHook->>ReactQuery: useMutation(config)
    Component->>APIHook: mutate(data)
    APIHook->>RequestUtil: Create Request
    RequestUtil->>API: HTTP POST Request
    API-->>RequestUtil: Response
    RequestUtil->>ReactQuery: Update Cache
    ReactQuery-->>Component: { data, isSuccess }
